    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The quantum kicked rotor is the quantization of physicskit.chaos&#x27;s classical StandardMap, p_{n+1} = p_n + k\sin\theta_n \pmod{2\pi}, \theta_{n+1} = \theta_n + p_{n+1} \pmod{2\pi}: a particle on a ring, kicked periodically by a potential k\cos\theta. Its one-period evolution is the unitary Floquet operator">

